#tasks-list.min-w-full
  - if tasks.any?
    div class="#{card_class} mb-6"
      h2.text-xl.font-semibold.text-slate-900 = t('dashboards.poster.title')
      p.text-slate-600.mt-2
        | Review your latest tasks and keep one active conversation moving forward.
    .grid.grid-cols-1.md:grid-cols-2.lg:grid-cols-3.gap-6
      - tasks.each do |task|
        = render "tasks/task_summary", task: task
    .mt-10
      = paginate tasks
  - else
    div class="#{card_class} text-center py-20 border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200"
      h3.text-xl.font-semibold.text-slate-700.mb-2
        |  No tasks found in this category. 
      p.text-slate-500.mb-6
        |  Try adjusting your filters or post a new task. 
      = link_to t('tasks.index.new_task'), new_task_path, class: button_class(:primary)